{[#]} 1. Nf7# {We have seen different mating patterns using Rook and Bishop.
Now let's see some using Rook and Knight. We have seen already similar mate
using Rook and Bishop. Now isntead of Bishop, there will be Knight. 1. Corner
Mate, as the name suggests, is a checkmate pattern against an enemy king that
is trapped in a corner. The actual checkmate is often executed by a knight.} *

